# ThreadScout Privacy Policy

ThreadScout processes Reddit post data to help moderators detect duplicate discussions.

The app may process post titles, post body text, post IDs, permalinks, subreddit names, similarity scores, moderation case statuses, and AI-generated explanations.

ThreadScout stores moderation case data and indexed post data in Reddit Devvit Redis storage to support duplicate detection and dashboard review.

ThreadScout may send post title/body text to the OpenAI API to generate embeddings and verify whether posts are likely duplicates.

ThreadScout does not collect personal contact information, sell user data, or use data for advertising.

Data is used only to provide duplicate detection and moderation support within the installed subreddit.
